<div id="pf9" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="9"><div class="pc pc9 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 ybd w3 h1d" alt="" src="bg9.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">2<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>物理层<span class="_ _2d"> </span><span class="ff3">2.4<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>数据传输的时延</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ybe ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：设传输总比特数为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑁<span class="_ _11"></span></span>，其中发生差错的比特数为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑁</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x37 h17 ybf ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑒</div><div class="t m0 x38 h7 ybe ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，则误码率为：</div><div class="t m0 x2a h18 yc0 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑃</div><div class="t m0 x39 h17 yc1 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑒</div><div class="t m0 x3a h19 yc0 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=</div><div class="t m0 x3b h18 yc2 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 x32 h17 yc3 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑒</div><div class="t m0 x3c h18 yc4 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑁</div><div class="t m0 x3d h8 yc0 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(2.3)</div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 yc5 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">误组率<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Pac<span class="_ _29"></span>ket<span class="_ _0"> </span>Er<span class="_ _f"></span>ror<span class="_ _0"> </span>Rate,<span class="_ _0"> </span>PER)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yc6 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：又称</span>误帧率<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Frame<span class="_ _0"> </span>Error Rate)<span class="ff4">。指在传输过程中，</span></span>出现错误的帧<span class="ff4">与</span>发送总帧数<span class="ff4">的比率。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yc7 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">判定<span class="ff4">：只要数据帧中</span>至少有一个比特<span class="ff4">发生错误，整个帧即被判定为出错。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yc8 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：设发送总帧数为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐾<span class="_ _11"></span></span>，其中出错的帧数为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐾</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x2b h17 yc9 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑒</div><div class="t m0 x3a h7 yc8 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，则误组率为：</div><div class="t m0 x3e h18 yca ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑃<span class="_ _f"></span>𝐸<span class="_ _20"> </span>𝑅<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffd">=</span></div><div class="t m0 x2c h18 ycb ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐾</div><div class="t m0 x3f h17 ycc ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑒</div><div class="t m0 x40 h18 ycd ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐾</div><div class="t m0 x3d h8 yca ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(2.4)</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 yce ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">2.4<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">数据传输的时延</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 ycf ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">指数据<span class="_ _f"></span>（一个报文或<span class="_ _f"></span>分组）从网络<span class="_ _f"></span>（或链路）的一<span class="_ _f"></span>端传送到另<span class="_ _f"></span>一端所需的<span class="_ _f"></span>时间。总时<span class="_ _f"></span>延是以下四<span class="_ _f"></span>种时延之</div><div class="t m0 x3 h7 yd0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">和。</div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 yd1 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">发送时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(T<span class="_ _29"></span>ransmission Dela<span class="_ _29"></span>y)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yd2 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _1"></span>又称<span class="ff1">传输时延</span>。<span class="_ _1"></span>是主机或路由器发送数据帧所需要的时间，<span class="_ _2e"></span>即从发送数据帧的第一个比特算起，</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 yd3 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">到该帧的最后一个比特发送完毕所需的时间。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yd4 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">符号<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff8">𝑡</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x41 h17 yd5 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yd6 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">影响因素<span class="ff4">：取决于数据帧长度和发送速率（带宽）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yd7 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：设数据帧长度为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐿<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">(bit)</span></span>，发送速率为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐶<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff3">(bit/s)</span></span>，则：</span></div><div class="t m0 x42 h18 yd8 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑡</div><div class="t m0 x36 h17 yd9 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x39 h19 yd8 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=</div><div class="t m0 x43 h18 yda ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x43 h18 ydb ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐶</div><div class="t m0 x3d h8 yd8 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(2.5)</div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 ydc ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">传播时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Propagation<span class="_ _0"> </span>Dela<span class="_ _29"></span>y)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ydd ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：是电磁波在信道中传输一定距离所需的时间。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yde ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">符号<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff8">𝑡</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x41 h17 ydf ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑝𝑟<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑜<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑝</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ye0 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">影响因素<span class="ff4">：取决于信道长度和电磁波在介质上的传播速率。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ye1 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：设信道长度为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐷<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">(m)</span></span>，电磁波在信道上的传播速率为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑣<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">(m/s)</span></span>，则：</span></div><div class="t m0 x44 h18 ye2 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑡</div><div class="t m0 x42 h17 ye3 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑝𝑟<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑜<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑝</div><div class="t m0 x2b h19 ye2 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=</div><div class="t m0 x19 h18 ye4 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐷</div><div class="t m0 x19 h18 ye5 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑣</div><div class="t m0 x3d h8 ye2 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(2.6)</div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 ye6 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">处理时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Processing<span class="_ _0"> </span>Dela<span class="_ _3"></span>y)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ye7 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：主机或路由器在收到分组时要花费一定时间进行处理。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ye8 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">内容<span class="ff4">：包括分析首部、提取数据、差错检验、查找路由表等。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 ye9 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">数值<span class="ff4">：通常很小，但在高速网络中可能成为瓶颈。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 yea ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">排队时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Queuing<span class="_ _0"> </span>Dela<span class="_ _3"></span>y)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yeb ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2c"></span>分组在经过网络传输时，<span class="_ _2c"></span>要经过许多路由器。<span class="_ _2c"></span>但分组在进入路由器后要先在输入队列中排队等</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 yec ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">待处理。在路由器确定了转发接口后，还要在输出队列中排队等待转发。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yed ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特性<span class="ff4">：排队时延的长短往往取决于网络当时的通信量。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yee ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">数值<span class="ff4">：当网络拥塞时，排队时延会急剧增加；若通信量很小，可忽略不计。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 yef ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">总时延计算</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yf0 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">公式<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x45 h7 yf1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">总时延<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>发送时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>传播时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>处理时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>排队时延<span class="_ _2f"> </span><span class="ff3">(2.7)</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h7 yf2 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">信道利用率</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yf3 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：指在数据传输过程中，信道用于传输有用数据的时间与总传输时间之比。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yf4 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">符号<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑈</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 yf5 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">计算<span class="ff4">：设发送时延为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑡</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x46 h17 yf6 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x17 h7 yf5 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，传播时延为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑡</span></div><div class="t m0 xc h17 yf6 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑝𝑟<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑜<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑝</div><div class="t m0 x36 h7 yf5 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">（通常算往返）<span class="_ _2"></span>，则信道利用率为：</div><div class="t m0 xc h18 yf7 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑈<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffd">=</span></div><div class="t m0 x2b h18 yf8 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑡</div><div class="t m0 x3a h17 yf9 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x47 h18 yfa ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑡</div><div class="t m0 x3e h17 yfb ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x2b h1a yfa ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">+<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑡</span></div><div class="t m0 x19 h17 yfb ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑝𝑟<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑜<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑝</div><div class="t m0 x3d h8 yf7 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(2.8)</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">4<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
